---
workflowId: {{q .ID}}
displayName: {{q .DisplayName}}
description: {{q .Description}}
version: 1.0.0
entrypoint: {{q .Entrypoint}}
broker:
  input_schema: {{.InputSchema}}
  egress:
    output: "result.json"
    max_bytes: {{.MaxBytes}}
    schema: {{.EgressSchema}}
{{- if .Proposes}}
  proposes:
{{- range .Proposes}}
    - action: {{q .Action}}
      tool: {{q .Tool}}
      output: {{q .Output}}
      args_schema: {{.ArgsSchema}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .Schedule}}
  schedule: {{.Schedule}}
{{- end}}
steps:
{{- range .Steps}}
  {{.Name}}:
    type: agent
    role: {{q .Role}}
    on_success: {{.Next}}
{{- end}}
terminals:
  done:
    status: COMPLETED
---

# {{.DisplayName}}

Rendered by the agent admin verbs for namespace {{.Namespace}}.

## Prompts
{{range .Steps}}
### {{.Name}}

{{.Instructions}}
{{if .Last}}
Write `artifacts/out/result.json` with exactly the approved egress shape.
{{- if $.Proposes}}
To propose a change, also write a file with exactly this shape, its args
matching the action's schema; each one waits for the user's approval:
{{- range $.Proposes}}
- {{.Action}}: `artifacts/out/{{.Output}}` containing `{"action": "{{.Action}}", "args": { ... }}`
{{- end}}
Write no other output file.
{{- else}} Write no other output file.
{{- end}}
{{end}}{{end}}
